%% Standalone sequence diagram for Mermaid tab preview
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Frontend
  participant WS as workspace.rs
  participant Doc as document.rs
  participant MR as Merman

  UI->>WS: load_workspace_mermaid(root, relative)
